# Minisforum V3 / V3 SE - LSM6DS3TR-C accelerometer mount matrix
# Source: https://github.com/mudkipme/awesome-minisforum-v3/issues/2#issuecomment-2279282784
sensor:modalias:acpi:SMO8B30*:dmi:*svnMicroComputer*:pnV3*
